                    {
                        "sense_id": "752b13ba-a958-343b-bf15-f2135f0b11f4",
                        "entry_id": "7be19ffa-ec3e-32ed-a3b4-4f63356b94df",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The process of modifying the bore of an engine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87ffd933-681b-4832-8b91-60a7c7e57c7d",
                                "sense_id": "752b13ba-a958-343b-bf15-f2135f0b11f4",
                                "text": "However, any increase in capacity is useful and, if an engine is worn and needs a rebore, it's worth considering boring to a near maximum size rather than simply having it bored to the next oversize."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
